      <h5 class="mb-1">Inquiry Reason Mapping <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success">Vendor Confirmed</span></h5>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-2">
        Creditinfo has confirmed both the code table below AND that <code>search/smart/individual</code> and <code>reports/custom</code> share ONE integer enum (superseding the manual's original, incorrect implication that search took a string enum). Which code DesertLedger sends for a given scenario is still our own business choice, editable below -- for a normal new loan application / affordability assessment, Creditinfo-confirmed code <strong>1</strong> (ApplicationForCreditOrAmendmentOfCreditTerms) is the recommended default.
      </p>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
          <label class="form-label">Inquiry Reason (Search)</label>
          <select name="creditinfo_inquiry_reason_search" class="form-select">
            <?php foreach (\App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes::INQUIRY_REASONS as $code => $label): ?>
              <option value="<?= (int) $code ?>" <?= (int) ($settings['creditinfo_inquiry_reason_search'] ?? \App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes::DEFAULT_NEW_CREDIT_INQUIRY_REASON) === $code ? 'selected' : '' ?>>
                <?= (int) $code ?> = <?= e($label) ?><?= $code === \App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes::DEFAULT_NEW_CREDIT_INQUIRY_REASON ? ' -- recommended for a new loan application' : '' ?>
              </option>
            <?php endforeach; ?>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
          <label class="form-label">Inquiry Reason (Report)</label>
          <select name="creditinfo_inquiry_reason_report" class="form-select">
            <?php foreach (\App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes::INQUIRY_REASONS as $code => $label): ?>
              <option value="<?= (int) $code ?>" <?= (int) ($settings['creditinfo_inquiry_reason_report'] ?? \App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes::INQUIRY_REASON_CUSTOMER_INQUIRY) === $code ? 'selected' : '' ?>>
                <?= (int) $code ?> = <?= e($label) ?>
              </option>
            <?php endforeach; ?>
          </select>
          <div class="form-text">Sent verbatim on <code>reports/custom</code>. Code 36 (CustomerInquiry) is the vendor's own working example and the current default.</div>
