      <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Both values above use the same Creditinfo-confirmed code table (<code>App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes</code>) -- there is nothing left to independently confirm about what a given code means, only which one fits a given business scenario.</p>

      <hr>
