      <p class="text-muted small mb-2">
        Creditinfo has confirmed in writing: <strong>1 = Male</strong>, <strong>2 = Female</strong> (<code>App\Support\CreditinfoV3Codes</code>). Still read from settings rather than hardcoded, so a future vendor correction is a settings change, not a deploy. A credit check remains blocked for any applicant while either field is unset.
      </p>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-3 mb-3">
          <label class="form-label">Code for Male</label>
